; File commands: MakeDir, Type, Copy, Rename, Delete, Protect, Filenote,
; Join, Search, Sort, SetDate (Phase 221)
FailAt 21
Delete work-files ALL QUIET >NIL:
MakeDir work-files
CD work-files
